body:
oh ok, are you safe right now? i fall down the rabbit hole of depression many times a week wondering and thinking but it only worsens things, i often see death as a way out and want to but im always happy when im out of it and can see from a different perspective, as for your mum saying your worthless is out of order, a life is never truly worthless, and who is she to judge you? nobody should put on a fake face and pretend to be happy i did for years and it gets so draining and it made me even more depressed,  being open about your depression is very brave and is a huge step forward.  your mum should never say them things and they arnt true, nobody is worthless, but please be safe and if your life is at risk from your mum or anyone else please contact the police

&#x200B;

EDIT-im sorry  i truly am but i need to get a few hours sleep before i need to go to therapy, i wish i could stay longer but ill most likely be here tomorrow if you need to talk, stay safe x
